    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d168">

                <pb facs="0404" n="118" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg118"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/268</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Spanish Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Riaño</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-12-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 27, 1916</hi>
                        </date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received December 28</hi>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary</hi>: His Holiness the Pope, Benedict XV, has asked the Government of His
                    Majesty the King of Spain, my August Sovereign, to felicitate, through me, the
                    Most Excellent the President of the United States, on the peace note addressed
                    to the belligerent nations.</p>
                <p>My Government has just instructed me by cablegram received this day to perform
                    the commission of His Holiness.</p>
                <p>Confirming the telephone conversation I just had with your excellency, I beg you
                    to have the goodness to ask the President of the Republic to designate the day
                    and hour when he will receive me so that I may have the honor of discharging the
                    above-mentioned pleasing mission.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of this opportunity [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Juan Riaño</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
